{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111794","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111794/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111794/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111794/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111794","id":3528927902,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7SVyqe","number":111794,"title":"Mesh becomes overly bright within an Omnilight if a DirectionalLight with shadows is present","user":{"login":"HungryProton","id":52043844,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDQzODQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52043844?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton","html_url":"https://github.com/HungryProton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-10-18T15:31:28Z","updated_at":"2025-10-18T16:56:07Z","closed_at":"2025-10-18T16:56:00Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n+ Tested with 4.5 with the Compatibility renderer\n+ Does **not** happen in Forward+\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Sun, 12 Oct 2025 12:45:18 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon RX 6600 (radeonsi, navi23, LLVM 20.1.8, DRM 3.64, 6.17.2-arch1-1) - AMD Ryzen 5 1600 Six-Core Processor (12 threads) - 15.54 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f5e8de6-4252-43df-bfcc-9f5347bc6258\n\nUsing a simple shader that emulates an unshaded material (see the reproduction steps below), the mesh within the omnilight gets a lot brighter than expected, but only if the shadows on the directional light are turned on.\n\nIf the shadows are off the result is correct.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n+ Add a `DirectionalLight` with shadows enabled\n+ Add an `OmniLight` \n+ Add a mesh with the following shader:\n```glsl\nshader_type spatial;\n\nuniform vec4 color : source_color = vec4(1.0);\n\n\nvoid fragment() {\n    ALBEDO = color.rgb;\n}\n\nvoid light() {\n    DIFFUSE_LIGHT = vec3(1.0);\n}\n```\n+ Move the mesh in and out of the omni light\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp_light_compatibility.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22985267/mrp_light_compatibility.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111794/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111794/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}